# Responsive UI

Every new or changed UI in `apps/web` / `packages/ui` must work on ~375px and ~768px as well as desktop. Do not ship desktop-only layouts.

## Breakpoints (Tailwind)

| Range | Use for |
| ----- | ------- |
| default / `<md` | Phone: compact chrome, list/card rows, Sheets for filters/nav |
| `md` (~768px) | Switch from mobile lists to tables where needed |
| `lg` (~1024px) | Sidebars, denser multi-column layouts |

Prefer `md` / `lg` over inventing custom breakpoints.

## Patterns

- **Shell**: Below `md`, hamburger + Sheet for nav; keep header to brand + primary actions (e.g. Sync icon, user). Put theme/incognito/secondary status in the Sheet or tooltips — never crowd the top bar with long status text.
- **Nav labels**: Short, `whitespace-nowrap`. Avoid long titles that wrap into adjacent controls (e.g. use “Email Sync”, not “Email Sync Status”).
- **Data tables**: Table at `md+`; below `md` use a single compact list/row (primary label + amount/meta). Prefer tap-to-edit over icon action clusters on mobile.
- **Filters**: Sidebar at `lg+`; below `lg` open filters in a `@repo/ui/sheet`.
- **KPIs / metrics**: On mobile show 1–2 primary metrics only; hide secondary cards with `hidden md:block` (or equivalent).
- **Density**: Tighter padding/gaps on small screens (`gap-2`, `p-2`/`p-2.5`, `text-sm`). Hide helper copy and info icons below `md` when they add noise.
- **Charts**: Shorter heights on small screens (`h-48`/`h-56` → taller at `md+`); parents need `min-w-0` so `ResponsiveContainer` does not overflow.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — desktop table/sidebar only; long header status; wrapping nav
<aside className="w-72">…filters…</aside>
<p className="text-sm">Last synced: {longTimestamp}</p>
<Link href="/email-sync">Email Sync Status</Link>

// ✅ GOOD — progressive disclosure
<aside className="hidden lg:block">…</aside>
<Sheet>…filters on small screens…</Sheet>
<SyncStatus statusVisibility="never" /> {/* timestamp in tooltip / sheet */}
<Link href="/email-sync" className="whitespace-nowrap">Email Sync</Link>
```

## Checklist before finishing UI work

- [ ] Usable at ~375px without horizontal overflow or colliding header items
- [ ] Tables/lists and filters follow mobile vs `md`/`lg` patterns above
- [ ] Secondary metrics/copy hidden on small screens
- [ ] Shared primitives (`Sheet`, denser `Table`/`Dialog`) reused from `@repo/ui` when needed
